  <data key="d0">Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Control and Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">controlsystem</data>
  <data key="d2">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 is fully automatic with Enapter’s EMS via 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi and Bluetooth, Modbus TCP over Ethernet.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
