<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Production Rate">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has a production rate of up to 500 NL/h, up to 1.0785 kg/24 h.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055456</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Hydrogen Output Purity">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has a hydrogen output purity of 99.9% at 35 barg with &lt;1,000 ppm H₂O and &lt;5 ppm O₂ at 25 °C, and 98.8% at 8 barg with &lt;12,000 ppm H₂O and &lt;5 ppm O₂ at 25 °C.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055456</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Output Pressure">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has an output pressure limit of up to 35 barg.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_limit</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055457</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Nominal Power Consumption per Nm³ of H₂ Produced">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has a nominal power consumption per Nm³ of H₂ produced of 4.8 kWh/Nm³, beginning of life.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055457</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Operative Power Consumption">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has an operative power consumption of 2.4 kW, beginning of life.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055458</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Peak Power Consumption">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has a peak power consumption of 3 kW.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_limit</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055459</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Heat Dissipation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has a heat dissipation of 0.6 kW, beginning of life.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055459</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Max Heat Dissipation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has a max heat dissipation of 0.9 kW, end of life.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_limit</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055460</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Standby Power Consumption">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has a standby power consumption of 0.3 kW.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055460</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Power Supply">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The power supply of 220 – 240 V (AC), 50/60 Hz feeds the Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0.&lt;SEP&gt;The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has a power supply of 220 – 240 V (AC), 50/60 Hz.</data>
  <data key="d9">feeds,has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055461</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Maximum Water Input Conductivity">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has a maximum water input conductivity specified as minimum ASTM D1193-06 Type IV or recommended Type II or Type III.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_limit</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055461</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Water Consumption">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has a water consumption of ~420 mL/h at 25 °C.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055462</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Water Input Pressure Range">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The water input pressure range of 1 – 4 barg feeds water into the Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0.&lt;SEP&gt;The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has a water input pressure range of 1 – 4 barg.</data>
  <data key="d9">feeds,has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055463</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Ambient Operative Temperature Range">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has an ambient operative temperature range of 5 °C – 45 °C.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055463</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Ambient Operative Humidity Range">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has an ambient operative humidity range of up to 90% humidity, non-condensing.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055464</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: IP Rating">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has an IP rating of IP 20.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_limit</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055464</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Dimensions">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has dimensions W: 482 mm × D: 635 mm × H: 266 mm.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055465</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Weight">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has a weight of 42 kg.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055465</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Space Inside Cabinet">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has 6 U space inside cabinet.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055466</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Control and Monitoring">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has fully automatic control and monitoring with Enapter’s EMS via 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi and Bluetooth, Modbus TCP over Ethernet.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055466</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 :: Conformity">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 has conformity including CE mark according to the machine directive 2006/42/CE, UKCA mark according to Supply Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008, and CSA/ANSI B22734:2023 Ed.1 Hydrogen Generators Using Water Electrolysis - Industrial, Commercial, and Residential Applications.</data>
  <data key="d9">conforms_to</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055467</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Oxygen">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 produces oxygen with output purity specified as &lt;5 ppm O₂ at both 35 barg and 8 barg.</data>
  <data key="d9">produces</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055468</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Water">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 consumes water with consumption of ~420 mL/h at 25 °C and input pressure range of 1–4 barg.</data>
  <data key="d9">consumes</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055468</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Enapters EMS">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Enapter’s EMS monitors the Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 via 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi and Bluetooth, Modbus TCP over Ethernet.&lt;SEP&gt;The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 uses Enapter’s EMS for fully automatic control and monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Enapter’s EMS controls the Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 in a fully automatic manner.</data>
  <data key="d9">controls,monitors,uses</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055469</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Wi-Fi">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 communicates via 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi for control and monitoring through Enapter’s EMS.</data>
  <data key="d9">communicates_via</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055470</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Bluetooth">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 communicates via Bluetooth for control and monitoring through Enapter’s EMS.</data>
  <data key="d9">communicates_via</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055470</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0" target="Modbus TCP over Ethernet">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Enapter AEM Electrolyser EL 4.0 communicates via Modbus TCP over Ethernet for control and monitoring through Enapter’s EMS.</data>
  <data key="d9">communicates_via</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d9f905a36fae7e407107d1a11e7b7200</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792055471</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
